"FC Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":147,"y":3062,"w":126,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/st-fiber-patch-cord","text":"ST Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":297,"y":3052,"w":154,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"ST Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":311,"y":3062,"w":126,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtrj-fiber-patch-cord","text":"MTRJ Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":461,"y":3052,"w":174,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTRJ Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":475,"y":3062,"w":146,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/lc-uniboot-and-lc-extractor-micro-cable","text":"LC Uniboot and LC Extractor Micro Cable","box":{"x":50,"y":3098,"w":285,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"LC Uniboot and LC Extractor Micro Cable","box":{"x":64,"y":3108,"w":257,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/armored-fiber-patch-cord","text":"Armored Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":345,"y":3098,"w":192,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"Armored Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":359,"y":3108,"w":164,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtp-mpo-array-cable","text":"MTP/MPO Array Cable","box":{"x":547,"y":3098,"w":171,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTP/MPO Array Cable","box":{"x":561,"y":3108,"w":143,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtp-mpo-trunk-cable","text":"MTP/MPO Trunk Cable","box":{"x":232,"y":3143,"w":173,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTP/MPO Trunk Cable","box":{"x":246,"y":3153,"w":145,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/fiber-adapters","text":"Fiber Adapters","box":{"x":414,"y":3143,"w":122,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber Adapters","box":{"x":428,"y":3153,"w":94,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Why source it through Vocom","box":{"x":16,"y":3344,"w":736,"h":35},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Build-to-order: specified to your route, count and jacket, not off a fixed shelf.","box":{"x":36,"y":3466,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Fujikura preform glass: tier 1 manufacturing, consistent quality.","box":{"x":36,"y":3580,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Lead times that move: supply when domestic loose-tube is quoted months out.","box":{"x":36,"y":3694,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Import/export handled: documentation, customs and delivery coordinated.","box":{"x":36,"y":3808,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Founded in 1998: a supplier that also runs networks.","box":{"x":36,"y":3921,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"FTTH drop cable FAQ","box":{"x":16,"y":4071,"w":736,"h":35},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"G.657.A1 or A2, which do we need?","box":{"x":38,"y":4156,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"A2 holds the tighter bend spec and is what most indoor and in-home work actually needs. A1 has fewer requirements and is fine on a straighter run. If the cable is going round door frames and into a room, specify A2.","box":{"x":38,"y":4190,"w":692,"h":74},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Do you supply pre-connectorized drops?","box":{"x":38,"y":4320,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes, with OptiTap compatible connectors to IP68 and GR-3120. Whether that beats field termination depends on your crew rate and your volume, and we are happy to work the numbers with you rather than push one.","box":{"x":38,"y":4354,"w":692,"h":74},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"What protects against rodent damage?","box":{"x":38,"y":4484,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"The armored drop series, NSS and SS, uses spiral armor for mechanical and rodent protection. It costs more per foot and saves more per callout.","box":{"x":38,"y":4518,"w":692,"h":50},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Can we reorder the same spec?","box":{"x":38,"y":4624,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes. Specs are held against your account, so a repeat order is a quantity and a date rather than a fresh conversation.","box":{"x":38,"y":4658,"w":692,"h":50},"links":[]},{"t":"h3","text":"What is an OptiTap compatible connector?","box":{"x":38,"y":4764,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"OptiTap is the common name for a hardened, sealed fiber drop connector format, first designed by one manufacturer and now available as compatible connectors from several sources. It lets a pre-connectorized drop be plugged into a terminal outdoors, in minutes and without splicing. Vocom supplies OptiTap compatible connectors rated IP68 and built to GR-326 and GR-3120, alongside flat drop cable.","box":{"x":38,"y":4798,"w":692,"h":124},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Need a Fiber Built to Your Exact Specification?","box":{"x":50,"y":4848,"w":668,"h":32},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber count, jacket, rating and connector, we can source and build any fiber optic cable to match your spec.","box":{"x":84,"y":4892,"w":600,"h":48},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./contact-vocomai","text":"Talk to a Specifier","box":{"x":283,"y":4952,"w":202,"h":45}},{"t":"p","text":"Talk to a Specifier","box":{"x":305,"y":4967,"w":132,"h":15},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":17},{"t":"a","href":"./","text":"","box":{"x":60,"y":5171,"w":33,"h":35}},{"t":"img","src":"https://framerusercontent.com/images/TTIbUaJpCfUwzR62SUUmiGgRfM.png?width=226&height=243","alt":"Vocom logo","box":{"x":60,"y":5171,"w":33,"h":35},"nat":[226,243]},{"t":"p","text":"Your partner for telecommunications and fiber optic supply.","box":{"x":60,"y":5233,"w":648,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/vocomai","text":"","box":{"x":60,"y":5276,"w":35,"h":35}},{"t":"svg","w":35},{"t":"p","text":"Quick Links","box":{"x":60,"y":5359,"w":89,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"VOCOM AI","box":{"x":60,"y":5402,"w":81,"h":27},"links":["./"]},{"t":"p","text":"Services","box":{"x":60,"y":5441,"w":66,"h":27},"links":["./vocom-services"]},{"t":"p","text":"RenOS AI Agents","box":{"x":60,"y":5481,"w":129,"h":27},"links":["./vocom-ai-agents"]},{"t":"p","text":"Resources","box":{"x":60,"y":5568,"w":81,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Resource Center","box":{"x":60,"y":5611,"w":127,"h":27},"links":["./resources"]},{"t":"p","text":"Blog","box":{"x":60,"y":5650,"w":34,"h":27},"links":["./blog"]},{"t":"p","text":"Company","box":{"x":404,"y":5359,"w":73,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"About Us","box":{"x":404,"y":5402,"w":70,"h":27},"links":["./about"]},{"t":"p","text":"Contact Us","box":{"x":404,"y":5441,"w":84,"h":27},"links":["./contact-vocomai"]},{"t":"p","text":"Privacy Policy","box":{"x":404,"y":5481,"w":106,"h":27},"links":["./vocom-privacy-policy"]},{"t":"p","text":"© 2026. All rights reserved","box":{"x":40,"y":5767,"w":688,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"img","src":"https://tracker.metricool.com/c3po.jpg?hash=a510ea6b2f7a6b3e8cf12a619c234f76","alt":null,"box":{"x":0,"y":5865,"w":1,"h":1},"nat":[1,1]}]